<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Nor silver nor gold hath obtained my redemption;</l><l>The guilt on my conscience too heavy had grown.</l><l>The blood of the cross is my only foundation;</l><l>The death of my Savior I only can own.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Nor silver nor gold hath obtained my redemption;</l><l>The holy commandment forbade me draw near.</l><l>The blood of the cross is my only foundation;</l><l>The death of my Savior removeth my fear.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Nor silver nor gold hath obtained my redemption;</l><l>The way to God’s kingdom could not thus be bought.</l><l>The blood of the cross is my only foundation;</l><l>The death of my Savior redemption hath wrought.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
